<title>SINGAPORE: Avimo suspended for announcement.</title>
<headline>Avimo suspended for announcement.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading of defence equipment group Avimo Group Ltd was suspended on Friday pending the announcement of a transaction, a company official said.</p>
</text>
